    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84362" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιο-νόμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέμω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feeding on grass</i> or <i>herbs,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοτά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1169
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			proparox. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιόνομος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ομή</span>)
				<i>with rich grassy fields,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					50
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
